<%# Footer: the placeholder mailto (metadata.email was a literal
    your-email@example.com stub) is gone - no personal contact info belongs
    in a public build. In its place: a link to the public GitHub repo (for
    source/contributing), a link to /credits/ (Andy Andrea as
    idea originator, the archivists/mirrors, and GitHub contributors), and
    a one-line license-TBD note, wired but asserting nothing specific -
    consistent with the placeholder LICENSE file at the repo root and the
    JSON-LD license placeholder (src/_components/json_ld.rb). %>
<footer class="site-footer">
  <%= render "flourish" %>
  <p class="site-footer__line">
    <a href="<%= metadata.repo_url %>">Ruby Lore on GitHub</a>
    &middot;
    <a href="/credits/">Credits</a>
  </p>
  <p class="site-footer__line site-footer__license">
    License: to be determined.
  </p>
</footer>
